  "interpretation": [
    "Korean strings are exact ko resource values; default Wi-Fi uses U+2011 non-breaking hyphen whereas ko Wi-Fi uses ASCII U+002D.",
    "Samsung sound heading is Sounds and vibration / 소리 및 진동; generic sound_settings is Sound / 소리 and is a distinct resource.",
    "Samsung homepage base XML has collapsing_app_bar and action_bar containers; checked subpage base content XML has collapsing_toolbar and action_bar. action_bar_title is a TextView in sesl_action_bar_title_item.xml.",
    "The existence of an ID/string and static title references does not establish current visible AccessibilityNodeInfo IDs, window titles, content descriptions, or route identity on the physical phone.",
    "No runtime association between the homepage title and a particular accessibility node is proven by these resources. Strict classifier must continue to require live package and positive heading evidence; unknown pages must remain denied."
